  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>15</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msup><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>15</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> Coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>15</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>(Given)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>945</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.